{
    "note": "dsh（DeepSeek Harness）压测剧本：每条都是 bash 工具调用（内容全为只读轻量命令），配 --exhausted loop 让 dsh 持续多轮工作。工具名与形状按 dsh 0.1.5-rc.2 实测：内建 shell 工具叫 bash（小写），参数是 {\"command\": …, \"description\": …} —— **两个都必填**，description 为空或缺失会被工具自己拒掉（tool result: Error: invalid arguments: missing required property \"description\"），所以照抄 scripts/perf-scenario.json（peri 的 Bash，只有 command）或 scripts/pi-scenario.json（有 command 没 description）都会被 dsh 判成参数非法。消费规律：一次 prompt 先发主请求（messages=4，带 system-reminder），紧接着发一条「会话标题生成」请求（messages=2，与主请求同 provider 同模型），之后每轮工具调用各一条主请求——编排剧本要把标题那条算进去。节奏（delayMs/chunkDelayMs/chunkSize）刻意压小，让 mock 的等待不成为瓶颈，测到的 CPU 主要来自 harness 自身的流解析与工具调度。",
    "defaults": {
        "delayMs": 10,
        "chunkDelayMs": 1,
        "chunkSize": 4
    },
    "responses": [
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "先看一眼当前目录里有什么。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_dsh_ls",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": {
                                "command": "ls",
                                "description": "List files in current directory"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "再打印一行标记，确认工具链路是通的。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_dsh_echo",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": {
                                "command": "echo llm-mock-perf-tick",
                                "description": "Print a marker line"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "接下来确认一下工作目录的绝对路径，这一步的文本刻意写长一点，让 SSE 流多切几片，好让 harness 的流式解析有稳定的负载，而不是每次都只处理两三个 chunk 就结束。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_dsh_pwd",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": {
                                "command": "pwd",
                                "description": "Show the working directory path"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "最后看一眼带属性的目录列表。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_dsh_ls_la",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": {
                                "command": "ls -la",
                                "description": "List directory entries with details"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        }
    ]
}
